{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/599016a4d2a50e721b38bc7948634a1a.avif?t=1764054746\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br>Eggs-traordinary times call for eggs-traordinary heroes.<br><br>After surviving the daring events of Chicken Run: Dawn of the Nugget, the gang is back in a brand-new adventure, and it turns out nuggets weren't the only thing on the menu - chickenkind is still in danger!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/5f6f0dd83fa5f92b860afec723522dff.poster.avif?t=1764054746\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/5f6f0dd83fa5f92b860afec723522dff.webm?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/5f6f0dd83fa5f92b860afec723522dff.mp4?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stealth with a Silly Twist \u2013 Hide in bins, disguise yourself as a traffic cone, or leg it in a full-blown panic. Whatever works.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/81e7bfb807cf300d9320c3775ad74841.poster.avif?t=1764054746\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/81e7bfb807cf300d9320c3775ad74841.webm?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/81e7bfb807cf300d9320c3775ad74841.mp4?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>High-Octane Escapes \u2013 Release those chickens and let the chaos ensue. Sure, chickens aren't meant to fly, but when the alternative is getting caught\u2026 we wing it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/87197fbe8b1415dab0261db454e48356.avif?t=1764054746\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br>Take control of Molly, Rocky, Frizzle and the gang as they sneak, scurry &amp; scramble through five tantalizingly treacherous fortified farms to liberate captured chickens.<br><br>But don\u2019t count your chicks until they\u2019re hatched \u2013 you\u2019ll need to outwit bumbling security, dodge watchful CCTV, and topple an army of loopy poultry villains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/4e5793483e4da3de6f1a5ca01c51cce7.poster.avif?t=1764054746\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/4e5793483e4da3de6f1a5ca01c51cce7.webm?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/4e5793483e4da3de6f1a5ca01c51cce7.mp4?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chaotic Co-op \u2013 Team up in two-player co-op to solve puzzles, cause absolute mayhem, and accidentally (or deliberately) ruin your friend's escape plan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/91450ebf7fc7cda9f847c4c5de9ee6e6.poster.avif?t=1764054746\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/91450ebf7fc7cda9f847c4c5de9ee6e6.webm?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/91450ebf7fc7cda9f847c4c5de9ee6e6.mp4?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Avians Assemble \u2013 Build a super squad of chickens to lead each mission, combining different traits, special powers and bonkers gadgets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/1287746196536087fd584db6a58b620e.avif?t=1764054746\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br>100% Chicken Run \u2013 Created at Aardman Animations, expect a brand-new feather-ruffling story packed with the evil villains, unexpected twists, and plenty of clucking good silliness.<br><br>The stakes are high, the chickens are feisty and the explosions inevitable.<br><br>Are you ready?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/9bc5d8c13cb0ff4440b4303e1ecc50a1.poster.avif?t=1764054746\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/9bc5d8c13cb0ff4440b4303e1ecc50a1.webm?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419690/extras/9bc5d8c13cb0ff4440b4303e1ecc50a1.mp4?t=1764054746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Brodents","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419690/b1f79520e618f5b842ff6365e9b2ec275c4608e3.jpg"},{"name":"The Kind Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419690/5900a104178d4800bfd2cc99778c213e5178d633.jpg"},{"name":"Eggstraction!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419690/bbd827b8827cfca1fc1f598d37f29bd59d964901.jpg"},{"name":"Environmentally Unfriendly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419690/b6351